    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d204">

                <pb facs="0292" n="270" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/10–3151: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the United States
                        Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d204-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-10-31T19:21:00-05:00">October 31,
                            1951—7:21 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p> Gadel 35. Re last para Delga 22 Oct 31 you are authorized discuss Chi Rep issue
                    carefully selected list key Dels such as you have indicated, stressing that at
                    same time US is seeking reach precise agreement UK on procedural details and
                    that these may require some last-minute modification.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d204-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d204-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated for information to London as 2274.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
